# Static response headers are merged with SvelteKit's generated immutable-asset
# rules by adapter-cloudflare. Cross-origin isolation is deliberately applied
# by hooks.server.ts to application responses only: COOP/COEP establish a
# document policy and must not be attached to ordinary immutable JavaScript
# modules. SQLocal's worker entry/chunks are the exception: that worker realm
# must receive the same isolation policy to open its OPFS-backed database.

/_app/immutable/workers/*
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
